tlosint-metagoofil (1.4.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. metagoofil 1.4.0 in a dedicated virtualenv under
    /opt/tracelabs/metagoofil, with hash-pinned dependencies.
  * First "tier C" package: upstream ships neither setup.py nor
    pyproject.toml, so pip cannot install it as a package. The virtualenv
    holds only the pinned dependencies; the upstream tree is fetched at build
    time, verified against the commit SHA and sha256 in debian/upstream.pin,
    and laid down verbatim beside the venv, reached through a wrapper.

 -- Trace Labs <jeff.g@tracelabs.org>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
